{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华啊，每次我与你争论，",{"text":"都显明你是对的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我还是和你讨论公正：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么恶人总是得势？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么诡诈之人反而生活安逸？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你栽培他们，让他们生根长大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"结出果实。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们嘴上尊崇你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心却远离你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华啊，你认识我，了解我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"察验我是否一心向你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你拖走他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像拖走待宰的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留到宰杀之日。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地哀恸、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的植物枯槁要到何时呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"由于这地方居民的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野兽和飞鸟都灭绝了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“上帝看不见我们的行为","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“如果你与步行的人竞走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尚且感到疲乏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又怎能与马赛跑呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你在安全之地尚且跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在约旦河边的丛林中又会怎样呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就连你的弟兄和家人都背叛了你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫嚣着与你为敌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任他们甜言蜜语，你不要相信。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"“我已离开我的殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撇弃我的产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我爱的子民交给他们的敌人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的产业像林中的狮子一样向我吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我憎恶他们；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的产业就像一只带斑点的鸷鸟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被其他鸷鸟围攻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去招聚一切野兽来吞吃它吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国的首领毁坏我的葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"践踏我美好的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之沦为荒凉的旷野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们使这片土地荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒凉之地在我面前哀哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遍地如此荒凉，却无人在意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭者已上到旷野中光秃的山岭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的刀剑横扫全境，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人可以平安稳妥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民播种麦子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却收割荆棘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"辛勤耕耘，却一无所获。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和华的烈怒，他们必收获羞辱。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华说：“邪恶的邻国侵占了我赐给我以色列子民的土地，我要将他们从本土连根拔起，我要将犹大家从他们中间连根拔起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我将他们连根拔起以后，还要再怜悯他们，把他们带回各自的家园和故土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["如果他们真心学习我子民的信仰，凭永活的耶和华之名起誓，正如他们教导我子民凭巴力起誓一样，他们必归入我的子民中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["如果哪一国不听我的话，我必把它连根拔起，彻底毁灭。这是耶和华说的。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"“上帝看不见我们的行为”参照《七十士译本》，希伯来文也可译作“他（指耶利米）看不见我们的结局”。","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}